  {
    "type": 0,
    "content": "I -vowel\nOI - vandals song \u201c____ to the world!\u201d\nION - manga series by arina tanemura\nTONI - Braxton Family singer\nPINTO - horse or bean type \nOPTION - choice among several\nPORTION - amount served at a meal\u2019\nPOSITRON - electric charge of +1\nRATPOISON - pest control chemical\nSTAINPROOF - resistant to decoloration, such as a fabric\nOUTFORASPIN - on a leisurely drive, say\n\n\n\nA - vowel\nRA - deity venerated in a pyramid\nRAD - awesome\nDORA - explorer with a map\nADORN - bedeck\n[??]\nROTUNDA - element of U.S. capitol\n\n\n\nE - vowel\nER - tv show that made george clooney a star\nERA - length of time something happens\nRACE - NASCAR even\nLECAR - Renault named in a faux-French style for the US market\nECLAIR - chaux pastry with custard and chocolate\nCALIBER - projectile diameter\n[??]\nCABRIOLET - convertible such as a drophead coupe\nORBICULATE - round like a leaf or a batfish\nCIRCLEABOUT - encompass\n\nO \u2014 vowel \nNO \u2014 word symbolized by a crossed red ring\nEON \u2014 time-traveler from ben 10\nNOTE \u2014 sixteenth, e.g.\nTONER \u2014 copier liquid\nORIENT \u2014 give a direction, as by a compass or HR seminar\nINUTERO \u2014 follow-up to Nevermind\nROUTINES \u2014 boring sequences\nOUTLINERS \u2014 word processors that create text files with tree structures\nRESOLUTION \u2014 you make this on New Year\u2019s\nREVOLUTIONS \u2014 events that transform governments",
